{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-23336","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-24289","text":"The Three-Protocol Stack: [&], PULSE, PRISM"}]},{"id":"blk-23337","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24290","text":"This document explains how the three [&] ecosystem protocols compose into a complete substrate for accountable, evolvable, benchmarkable agent systems."}]},{"id":"blk-23338","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  PRISM    — measures loops over time      (diagnostic)   │ OS-009\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  PULSE    — declares loops + circulation   (temporal)    │ OS-010\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  [&]      — composes capabilities          (structural)  │ AmpersandBoxDesign\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"},{"id":"blk-23339","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-24291","text":"What each layer answers"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-23341","spans":[{"id":"spn-24292","text":"Layer"}]},{"id":"blk-23342","spans":[{"id":"spn-24293","text":"Question"}]},{"id":"blk-23343","spans":[{"id":"spn-24294","text":"Artifact"}]}],"id":"blk-23340","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-23344","spans":[{"id":"spn-24295","text":"[[&]](../../AmpersandBoxDesign/docs/index.md)"}]},{"id":"blk-23345","spans":[{"id":"spn-24296","text":"What can each agent do, and how do they compose?"}]},{"id":"blk-23346","spans":[{"id":"spn-24297","marks":["code"],"text":"*.ampersand.json"}]}],[{"id":"blk-23347","spans":[{"id":"spn-24298","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/spec/OS-010-PULSE-SPECIFICATION.md"}],"text":"PULSE"}]},{"id":"blk-23348","spans":[{"id":"spn-24299","text":"How do their processes cycle and signal each other?"}]},{"id":"blk-23349","spans":[{"id":"spn-24300","marks":["code"],"text":"*.pulse.json"},{"id":"spn-24301","text":" (loop manifest)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-23350","spans":[{"id":"spn-24302","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/spec/OS-009-PRISM-SPECIFICATION.md"}],"text":"PRISM"}]},{"id":"blk-23351","spans":[{"id":"spn-24303","text":"How well do those cycles actually work over time?"}]},{"id":"blk-23352","spans":[{"id":"spn-24304","text":"Diagnostic reports + leaderboards"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-23353","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24305","text":"A customer adopting all three writes (at minimum) two files:"}]},{"id":"blk-23354","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"acme-insurance/\n├── acme.ampersand.json   # [&] — capability declarations\n└── acme.pulse.json       # PULSE — loop topology + cadence + connections"},{"id":"blk-23355","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24306","text":"PRISM does not require a separate file — it reads the PULSE manifest directly to discover phases, signatures, and substrates."}]},{"id":"blk-23356","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-24307","text":"Three closed loops, three nesting levels"}]},{"id":"blk-23357","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24308","text":"The reference [&] ecosystem already operates with three nested loops:"}]},{"id":"blk-23358","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"PRISM (outer)        compose → interact → observe → reflect → diagnose\n  │\n  └─ Graphonomous    retrieve → route → act → learn → consolidate\n       │\n       └─ Deliberation    survey → triage → dispatch → act → learn"},{"id":"blk-23359","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24309","text":"PULSE encodes this nesting in the "},{"id":"spn-24310","marks":["code"],"text":"nesting"},{"id":"spn-24311","text":" block of each manifest:"}]},{"id":"blk-23360","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23362","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24312","marks":["code"],"text":"prism.benchmark"},{"id":"spn-24313","text":" declares "},{"id":"spn-24314","marks":["code"],"text":"inner_loops: [graphonomous.continual_learning]"}]}],"id":"blk-23361","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23364","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24315","marks":["code"],"text":"graphonomous.continual_learning"},{"id":"spn-24316","text":" declares "},{"id":"spn-24317","marks":["code"],"text":"inner_loops: [graphonomous.deliberate]"}]}],"id":"blk-23363","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23366","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24318","marks":["code"],"text":"graphonomous.deliberate"},{"id":"spn-24319","text":" declares "},{"id":"spn-24320","marks":["code"],"text":"parent_loop: graphonomous.continual_learning"}]}],"id":"blk-23365","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-23367","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24321","text":"OS-008 (Agent Harness, draft) is expected to add a fourth outer layer. PULSE supports unbounded nesting depth — adding OS-008 is just another manifest with "},{"id":"spn-24322","marks":["code"],"text":"inner_loops: [prism.benchmark]"},{"id":"spn-24323","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-23368","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-24324","text":"How signals flow"}]},{"id":"blk-23369","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24325","text":"Cross-loop signals carry one of five canonical tokens through CloudEvents-compatible envelopes:"}]},{"id":"blk-23370","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"                              ┌────────────────────┐\n                              │  ReputationUpdate  │ ────────────────┐\n                              └────────────────────┘                  │\n                                       ▲                              ▼\n                                       │                    ┌──────────────────┐\n                              ┌────────┴────────┐           │ fleetprompt.trust │\n                              │ OutcomeSignal   │           │  (marketplace)    │\n                              └────────┬────────┘           └──────────────────┘\n                                       │\n        ┌──────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┐\n        │                              │                            │\n        ▼                              ▼                            ▼\n┌──────────────┐            ┌──────────────────┐         ┌────────────────────┐\n│ graphonomous │ ──signal──▶│  prism.benchmark │         │ agentromatic.delib │\n│ (memory loop)│            │ (eval loop)      │         │ (consensus loop)   │\n└──────┬───────┘            └────────┬─────────┘         └─────────┬──────────┘\n       │                             │                              │\n       │ TopologyContext             │ DeliberationResult           │\n       ▼                             ▼                              ▼\n┌──────────────┐            ┌──────────────────┐         ┌────────────────────┐\n│ ConsolidationEvent          (read by other loops as substrate state)        │\n└──────────────┘            └──────────────────┘         └────────────────────┘"},{"id":"blk-23371","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24326","text":"The five tokens are stable for v0.1:"}]},{"id":"blk-23372","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23374","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24327","marks":["code"],"text":"TopologyContext"},{"id":"spn-24328","text":" — emitted by "},{"id":"spn-24329","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-24330","text":", consumed by "},{"id":"spn-24331","marks":["code"],"text":"route"}]}],"id":"blk-23373","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23376","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24332","marks":["code"],"text":"DeliberationResult"},{"id":"spn-24333","text":" — emitted by inner deliberation loops"}]}],"id":"blk-23375","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23378","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24334","marks":["code"],"text":"OutcomeSignal"},{"id":"spn-24335","text":" — emitted by "},{"id":"spn-24336","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-24337","text":" after action results"}]}],"id":"blk-23377","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23380","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24338","marks":["code"],"text":"ReputationUpdate"},{"id":"spn-24339","text":" — canonical reputation/confidence delta"}]}],"id":"blk-23379","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23382","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24340","marks":["code"],"text":"ConsolidationEvent"},{"id":"spn-24341","text":" — emitted by "},{"id":"spn-24342","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate"},{"id":"spn-24343","text":" phases"}]}],"id":"blk-23381","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-23383","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-24344","text":"Conformance composition"}]},{"id":"blk-23384","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24345","text":"A loop is "},{"id":"spn-24346","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE-conforming"},{"id":"spn-24347","text":" if its manifest validates against "},{"id":"spn-24348","marks":["code"],"text":"pulse-loop-manifest.v0.1.json"},{"id":"spn-24349","text":" and its runtime passes all 12 conformance tests."}]},{"id":"blk-23385","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24350","text":"A system is "},{"id":"spn-24351","marks":["bold"],"text":"PRISM-evaluable"},{"id":"spn-24352","text":" automatically once it is PULSE-conforming — PRISM's "},{"id":"spn-24353","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-24354","text":" phase reads the manifest, injects scenarios at the declared "},{"id":"spn-24355","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-24356","text":" boundary, and observes outcomes via the declared "},{"id":"spn-24357","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-24358","text":" phase."}]},{"id":"blk-23386","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24359","text":"A system is "},{"id":"spn-24360","marks":["bold"],"text":"[&]-composable"},{"id":"spn-24361","text":" if its agents declare capabilities with matching "},{"id":"spn-24362","marks":["code"],"text":"accepts_from"},{"id":"spn-24363","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-24364","marks":["code"],"text":"feeds_into"},{"id":"spn-24365","text":" contracts."}]},{"id":"blk-23387","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24366","text":"The three layers are independent. A system may adopt one without the others. Adoption order is typically:"}]},{"id":"blk-23388","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23390","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24367","marks":["bold"],"text":"[&]"},{"id":"spn-24368","text":" (capability declarations) — earliest, lowest commitment"}]}],"id":"blk-23389","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23392","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24369","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE"},{"id":"spn-24370","text":" (loop manifest) — when the system has closed feedback"}]}],"id":"blk-23391","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23394","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24371","marks":["bold"],"text":"PRISM"},{"id":"spn-24372","text":" (benchmarking) — when the loop is ready to be measured"}]}],"id":"blk-23393","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-23395","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-24373","text":"Why three protocols, not one"}]},{"id":"blk-23396","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24374","text":"A monolithic protocol covering capabilities, loops, and benchmarking would be larger, harder to evolve, and harder to adopt incrementally. The three-layer split mirrors how HTTP, HTML, and CSS became ubiquitous separately before converging in the browser."}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-23398","spans":[{"id":"spn-24375","text":"Concern"}]},{"id":"blk-23399","spans":[{"id":"spn-24376","text":"Layer"}]},{"id":"blk-23400","spans":[{"id":"spn-24377","text":"Cadence of change"}]}],"id":"blk-23397","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-23401","spans":[{"id":"spn-24378","text":"What can be done"}]},{"id":"blk-23402","spans":[{"id":"spn-24379","text":"[&]"}]},{"id":"blk-23403","spans":[{"id":"spn-24380","text":"months–years"}]}],[{"id":"blk-23404","spans":[{"id":"spn-24381","text":"How it cycles"}]},{"id":"blk-23405","spans":[{"id":"spn-24382","text":"PULSE"}]},{"id":"blk-23406","spans":[{"id":"spn-24383","text":"weeks–months"}]}],[{"id":"blk-23407","spans":[{"id":"spn-24384","text":"How well it works"}]},{"id":"blk-23408","spans":[{"id":"spn-24385","text":"PRISM"}]},{"id":"blk-23409","spans":[{"id":"spn-24386","text":"continuous"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-23410","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24387","text":"Different rates of change deserve different protocols."}]},{"id":"blk-23411","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-24388","text":"Related"}]},{"id":"blk-23412","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23414","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24389","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/ECOSYSTEM.md"}],"text":"Ecosystem overview"},{"id":"spn-24390","text":" — how every product fits the stack"}]}],"id":"blk-23413","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23416","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24391","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/STACK_COMPLETION.md"}],"text":"Stack status"},{"id":"spn-24392","text":" — versions, test counts, deployment state"}]}],"id":"blk-23415","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23418","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24393","text":"[[&] Protocol docs](../../AmpersandBoxDesign/docs/index.md) — capability composition (structural)"}]}],"id":"blk-23417","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23420","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24394","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/spec/OS-010-PULSE-SPECIFICATION.md"}],"text":"OS-010 PULSE specification"},{"id":"spn-24395","text":" — loop + circulation algebra (temporal)"}]}],"id":"blk-23419","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23422","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24396","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/spec/OS-009-PRISM-SPECIFICATION.md"}],"text":"OS-009 PRISM specification"},{"id":"spn-24397","text":" — cross-system benchmark (diagnostic)"}]}],"id":"blk-23421","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23424","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24398","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/graphonomous/docs/spec/README.md"}],"text":"Graphonomous spec"},{"id":"spn-24399","text":" — the reference memory loop these protocols compose around"}]}],"id":"blk-23423","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-23425","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-24400","text":"PULSE implementation docs"}]},{"id":"blk-23426","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23428","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24401","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/PULSE/docs/ARITHMETIC_INTEGRATION.md"}],"text":"Arithmetic Integration"},{"id":"spn-24402","text":" — how PULSE phases gate on the box-and-box kernel verdict"}]}],"id":"blk-23427","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23430","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24403","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/PULSE/docs/V0.2-BEHAVIORAL-TYPES.md"}],"text":"V0.2 Behavioral Types"},{"id":"spn-24404","text":" — session-typed phase contracts (draft)"}]}],"id":"blk-23429","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23432","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24405","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/PULSE/docs/V0.2-IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md"}],"text":"V0.2 Implementation Plan"},{"id":"spn-24406","text":" — roadmap for the v0.2 manifest schema"}]}],"id":"blk-23431","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-23434","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-24407","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/PULSE/docs/NPM_PACKAGE.md"}],"text":"NPM Package"},{"id":"spn-24408","text":" — the PULSE validator/conformance package"}]}],"id":"blk-23433","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraqa2voo2ymnfsd6rem2wlfzmzk3nfiajphwvqaubkvqqexiwpo3ua","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}